  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program for Strategic International Positioning II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Posicionamiento Estratgico Internacional II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de esta serie de operaciones programticas es contribuir a laconsolidacin del posicionamiento internacional de Uruguay mediante elfortalecimiento del marco normativo e institucional para la atraccin deinversiones, la mejora de la promocin y facilitacin comercial, y lamaximizacin del impacto local de dicho posicionamiento. Los objetivosespecficos del programa son: (i) impulsar la atraccin de inversiones orientadas asectores de alto valor agregado; (ii) mejorar los estndares de promocin yfacilitacin comercial; y (iii) mejorar el desarrollo de las capacidades locales deinnovacin y absorcin tecnolgica.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of this series of programmatic operations is to help consolidate the international positioning of Uruguay by strengthening the legal and institutional framework for attracting investment, improving trade promotion and facilitation, and maximizing the local impact of that positioning. The specific objectives are to: (i) promote the attraction of investments to high value-added sectors; (ii) upgrade trade promotion and facilitation standards; and (iii) improve the development of local capacity to innovate and assimilate technology.</narrative>
  </description>
